{"3388770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tides of Lava", "steam_appid": 3388770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to protect your base from relentless enemy hordes in a constantly changing environment? There's only one way to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/3db844256b5c3a5609c991e3daab3dd0.avif?t=1768696118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras_big/3db844256b5c3a5609c991e3daab3dd0.avif?t=1768696118 width=800 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tides of Lava is a Roguelike Tower Defense game with several unique features not typically found in traditional tower defense games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    1. <strong>Tower Modifications</strong>: Every 2.5 minutes you'll receive a tower modification that applies to all towers of the same type. Combine these mods to customize your towers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/7ad27878ee51b939b255cb0100872be2.poster.avif?t=1768696118\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/7ad27878ee51b939b255cb0100872be2.webm?t=1768696118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/7ad27878ee51b939b255cb0100872be2.mp4?t=1768696118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    2. <strong>Grid-based building system:</strong> Enjoy the freedom and flexibility of a grid-based building system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/9ba7ac57eda92eb7084ca6866215b179.poster.avif?t=1768696118\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/9ba7ac57eda92eb7084ca6866215b179.webm?t=1768696118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/9ba7ac57eda92eb7084ca6866215b179.mp4?t=1768696118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    3. <strong>No resources:</strong> Manage your builders efficiently as there are no other resource constraints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    4. <strong>Dynamic Enemy Paths:</strong> Enemy paths change over time, keeping you on your toes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/51c3158b66297b21e7b7c31e8e321854.poster.avif?t=1768696118\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/51c3158b66297b21e7b7c31e8e321854.webm?t=1768696118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/51c3158b66297b21e7b7c31e8e321854.mp4?t=1768696118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    5. <strong>Evolving Environments:</strong> Each environment has its own unique quirks and provides you with different challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/d7a73a8ce2e45042f11f688f51384c7a.avif?t=1768696118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras_big/d7a73a8ce2e45042f11f688f51384c7a.avif?t=1768696118 width=800 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Tides of Lava</strong></i>, no two runs are the same due to the changing enemy paths and environments. When you die, it's game over—you'll need to restart with only your gained experience to help you progress further. How many attempts will it take for you to conquer the game?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to protect your base from relentless enemy hordes in a constantly changing environment? There's only one way to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/3db844256b5c3a5609c991e3daab3dd0.avif?t=1768696118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras_big/3db844256b5c3a5609c991e3daab3dd0.avif?t=1768696118 width=800 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tides of Lava is a Roguelike Tower Defense game with several unique features not typically found in traditional tower defense games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    1. <strong>Tower Modifications</strong>: Every 2.5 minutes you'll receive a tower modification that applies to all towers of the same type. Combine these mods to customize your towers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/7ad27878ee51b939b255cb0100872be2.poster.avif?t=1768696118\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/7ad27878ee51b939b255cb0100872be2.webm?t=1768696118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/7ad27878ee51b939b255cb0100872be2.mp4?t=1768696118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    2. <strong>Grid-based building system:</strong> Enjoy the freedom and flexibility of a grid-based building system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/9ba7ac57eda92eb7084ca6866215b179.poster.avif?t=1768696118\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/9ba7ac57eda92eb7084ca6866215b179.webm?t=1768696118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/9ba7ac57eda92eb7084ca6866215b179.mp4?t=1768696118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    3. <strong>No resources:</strong> Manage your builders efficiently as there are no other resource constraints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    4. <strong>Dynamic Enemy Paths:</strong> Enemy paths change over time, keeping you on your toes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/51c3158b66297b21e7b7c31e8e321854.poster.avif?t=1768696118\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/51c3158b66297b21e7b7c31e8e321854.webm?t=1768696118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/51c3158b66297b21e7b7c31e8e321854.mp4?t=1768696118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    5. <strong>Evolving Environments:</strong> Each environment has its own unique quirks and provides you with different challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/d7a73a8ce2e45042f11f688f51384c7a.avif?t=1768696118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras_big/d7a73a8ce2e45042f11f688f51384c7a.avif?t=1768696118 width=800 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Tides of Lava</strong></i>, no two runs are the same due to the changing enemy paths and environments. When you die, it's game over—you'll need to restart with only your gained experience to help you progress further. How many attempts will it take for you to conquer the game?</p>", "short_description": "A strategic tower defense roguelike game with a grid-based building system and constantly changing enemy paths and environments. Manage your builders efficiently to defend your base against a variety of enemies. Adaptiveness is the key to winning - do you have what it takes?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/header.jpg?t=1768696118", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/757aba4efbac8abf98aa1a3cde6e3cf7e55d4aa9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768696118", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/757aba4efbac8abf98aa1a3cde6e3cf7e55d4aa9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768696118", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor: